WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.320
Take it!

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.610
Save PriPara!

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.320
What has happened?

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.660
For a PriPara to have it's goddess disappear...

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:24.150
This has never happened before in the long history of PriPara.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.120
The Sky Stage is falling!

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.520
What's happening-pri!?

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.910
Jululu, Janice...

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:14.980
I Friend You

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.910
We sure are getting ahead on our maintenance

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:23.020
with the Divine Idol Grand Prix happening, right, Meganee-san?

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:24.830
Of course, Meganee-san!

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.220
What's that?

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:37.580
The Sky Stage is falling!

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:42.380
No!

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:47.110
Because the Goddesses have gone, the field that was supporting the Sky Stage has disappeared!

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.330
The Sky Stage is falling!

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.370
The Sky Elevator isn't working either!

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.480
Don't fall! Stop!

00:02:56.760 --> 00:03:00.250
Jululu, please come back!

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:01.650
Janice!

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:10.560
I guess this really is goodbye to PriPara.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.200
It stopped!

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.310
No, it's just falling more slowly!

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:32.930
Bonjour!

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:38.500
Bravo on the Divine Idols!

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.190
You've done it!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.500
Now's not the time for celebrations.

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:43.890
I know that!

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:49.710
To think you'd lose the new Goddess Janice as well after Julie disappeared...

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:54.380
All PriPara's are in the midst of storms right now.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:57.560
We're being exposed to some crazy magnetic fields.

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:59.320
All PriParas?

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:00.720
What on earth!?

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:03.740
So every single PriPara's system is broken?

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:05.840
They're gonna go down.

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:08.270
And that's not all!

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:11.950
Even Parajuku is looking a bit strange.

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:17.760
It seems that this abnormal phenomenon is coming from the Prism Stone shop.

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:19.850
That's bad-kuma!

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:21.770
It's even outside PriPara-dechu!?

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:23.830
I knew this would happen-tori!

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:25.910
Can you not repair the system-nekon?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.270
No!

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:29.200
You're all useless!

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:33.380
This emergency is your responsibility!

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:37.280
I knew we shouldn't have left Parajuku to you!

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:40.480
Now is not the time to say stuff like that-dechu!

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:43.220
That's why everyone says you're annoying-dechu!

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:50.690
Mirei!

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:51.760
Pri!

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:53.280
Sophie!

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:54.240
Yeah.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:56.110
Let's sing!

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.790
Because we're Divine Idols!

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:58.270
Pri!

00:04:58.270 --> 00:04:58.710
Okay!

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:02.160
If Divine Idols sing, a miracle should happen-pri!

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:05.450
That's why we worked so hard.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:06.960
Capisce!

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:09.860
Everyone, calm down!

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:13.400
We'll save PriPara and bring back Janice and Jululu

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:15.420
with a Divine Idol song!

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:18.710
Yeah! Hurry up and sing Solami Smile!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:22.800
When it comes to miracles, they're definitely

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:26.160
within the realms of possibility for Divine Idols. But...

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:30.780
It's going-nano!

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:35.860
I'm slipping!

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:48.200
Hold on!

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:49.490
Thanks.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.770
Aromat Card: Hope!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:54.040
Go! Gajira!

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.910
Bow down before me!

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:03.330
Love Game!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:05.960
Everyone! Stand firm!

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.910
We'll cushion your fall-kuma!

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.450
Easier than in the Sappannah!

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:17.940
Sumo!

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:22.190
I'm riding pegasus!

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:28.970
Jululu?

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:32.940
Kyupikon!

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:36.650
Nanami!

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.140
You came back!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.390
Kyupikon!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:42.200
We'll always be friends!

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:43.460
Kyupikon!

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.880
The tilting has stopped-usa!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.490
Are you okay everyone?

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:49.950
Yes!

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.120
Are you hurt?

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.760
No!

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:56.250
That was scary, what's gonna happen to PriPara?

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:05.120
PriPara... I don't want PriPara to disappear!

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:06.890
I won't let it!

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.090
Ever!

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:15.370
I've gotta sing!

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:18.770
Lala!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:27.860
Lala, Mom gave me that name...

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:33.900
So that I could always sing "la la la" and be happy!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:35.840
Lala.

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:39.760
And so, I will sing!

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.710
Jewlie-san! Janice-sama!

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:51.310
Please come back!

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:58.950
We're safe for now, but...

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.850
I don't know how long the roof with hold for.

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:03.700
This is all I can do for now.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.060
Even though I used to be just a Sparkling Experimental idol,

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.760
I've been singing at PriPara every day!

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:21.040
And I've become a Divine Idol!

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.820
I've got so much out of PriPara!

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.060
Met so many friends...

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:28.100
Mirei...

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:31.790
Mirei! Don't give up!

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:35.610
You can do it, you can save PriPara!

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.080
STYLISH!

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:49.300
TOUGH!

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.080
GUY!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:53.710
I can't,

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.020
put this off...

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:57.710
any longer!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:58.930
Come on, keep going-pri!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.100
Psshu.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.420
Hold on.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.400
Okay, let's do this!

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:07.440
Everyone!

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:10.480
We're Solami Smile, the Divine Idols-pri!

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:15.420
Everyone, lend us you strength to protect PriPara-pri!

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:19.650
Although we've only just become Divine Idols...

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:23.070
We want to work a miracle!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.770
We have to!

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.890
So please, lend us your strength!

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:35.680
I was born...

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:39.340
to protect the idols!

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:44.690
The procrastination has been postponed.

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:46.560
Ugh, lame...

00:09:58.220 --> 00:09:59.360
They're back!

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.550
Thank god!

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:46.360
We'll sing until we collapse!

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:51.370
Jululu, we're Divine Idols, so come back, please?

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:56.430
Janice, the singing voice of a Divine Idol must do something, right-pri!?

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:13.150
Janice, give them your strength!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:16.460
The song of a Divine Idol...

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.020
Is it really enough to save PriPara?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:24.910
Jululu!

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:26.460
Janice!

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:28.320
Can you hear our song?

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:38.810
We can't give up! We have to keep going-pri!

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.290
Is it too much even for Divine Idols?

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.300
Watch out!

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:57.450
You can't stop now!

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:25.030
Yes! The power of friendship!
This is exactly what we needed!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:28.590
We're all friends, we're all idols!

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:48.660
Jululu!

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:50.150
It's Jewlie!

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:51.180
Janice too!

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:52.420
Come quickly!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:55.270
Jululu, Mama will help you!

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:57.970
I'll do anything it takes!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.810
We'll show you the <i>true</i> power of Divine Idols!

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.740
There's still more!

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:13.100
Everyone, show them the power of friendship-pri!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.330
The power will make PriPara stronger!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:18.950
Everyone who's fallen out, stop being stubborn and admit your true feelings.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:21.200
How's about you send them a text?

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.940
Let's lick each other!

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:25.380
Let's sparkle!

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:28.170
Forgive them for lying!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.240
Believe in your friends!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.960
You can start by getting on your knees and begging!

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:34.660
Joint Solidarity!

00:16:35.030 --> 00:16:36.450
You could always go to hell...

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:38.730
I'll come too-garu!

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:39.960
Capisce!

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:44.850
Divine Cyalume Change!

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:14.690
Everyone, snap!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.610
Are you ready-pri?

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:18.080
You know what you have to do.
Yeah!

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.560
Yeah!

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:35.840
PriPara! Resurrect!

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.240
Grant me this miracle!

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:39.450
Three!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.780
Do you like PriPara-pri?

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:42.820
Yeah!

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:44.360
Two!

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:46.090
One!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.520
Then it'll all be okay!

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:50.610
Zero!

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:35.980
Jululu.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:40.790
Mama!

00:18:53.470 --> 00:18:57.500
I guess you could say nothing really changed after all that...

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.060
You could, Meganee-san!

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:06.270
So hell has vanished-dearu...

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:07.990
A miracle has happened

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:13.230
Jewlie-san, your sins have been forgiven, and everything has been reset.

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:17.030
That's the conclusion of the Meganii Council.

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:20.390
You're all cleared and free to go.

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:24.140
As the aide of Janice, the new goddess of PriPara...

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:27.710
Please take good care of us.

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:32.780
Thank you, all.

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:35.820
I knew that you all...

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:38.340
would be able to save my sister.

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:40.840
Janice!

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:47.080
I-I guess we can't be so casual anymore, since you're a Goddess now and all...

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:48.410
Can we?

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.960
I know a certain someone who would like to be licked!

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:59.170
Thank you Mama, Mirei, Sophie!

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:02.380
You're all spectacular Divine Idols.

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:03.810
Thank you.

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:08.370
Jululu, now that you've got no Divine responsibilities, how about you come and live with us?

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:11.310
Thanks Mama, but...

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:12.650
Jululu?

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:15.430
Are you disappearing?

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:20.870
I guess, my body seems to be changing.

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:26.420
W-What's going on? Is it the flu?

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:31.780
Mom, I've had a job I've always wanted to do.

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:34.930
And this body type is perfect for it!

00:20:34.930 --> 00:20:36.700
Jululu!

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:41.360
I leave PriPara to you.

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:44.220
I love you, Mama!

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:46.290
Jululu, don't go!

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:47.850
We'll meet again.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:52.280
Don't worry, we'll always be together!

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:56.500
As I'm with every idol in their hearts!

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:03.970
Leave PriPara to me, Onee-sama.

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:07.930
Jululu...

00:21:09.170 --> 00:21:11.360
She said she'd be with us-pri.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:14.200
I wonder what the job she wanted to do was?

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:17.230
I believe in her.

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:21.020
We'll be fine, she's with us in spirit.

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:24.860
Me too, I want to give you all a <i>huge</i> lick!

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:28.050
Thank you...

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:32.490
I love you Jululu, we'll meet again for sure.

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:36.070
And so, from today, I'm a Goddess.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:41.000
I'll take everything I've learned from my sister to heart and protect PriPara.

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:44.540
I wonder if we'll meet again...

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:48.620
We'll definitely become greater idols

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:51.600
and challenge for the Divine Idol Grand Prix again!

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:54.150
And then we'll meet again, right?

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:58.820
Of course, PriPara and idols are forever!

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:03.300
Janice, please take care of PriPara.

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:08.020
Jululu, thank you for everything.

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:12.990
I wonder how long she meant when she said "we'll meet again"?
